   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Yangzhou Canal Scenic Beauty</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Yangzhou Ancient Canal: Winter and Summer Scenic Beauty\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the paper's own stimuli: participants say whether they have a landscape-architecture education background and give their education level, then rate ten photographs of five sites on the Yangzhou ancient Grand Canal (each in winter and in summer) in the paper's order, No. 1 to No. 10, on the paper's seven-point scale from -3 (strongly dislike) to +3 (strongly like). Rebuilt from Wang, Qian, Cao, Fan & Han (2025), Scientific Reports 15: 7500, with the photographs printed in the paper's Fig. 4 (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0; the figure file is used unaltered and each photo is shown by cropping the view in the browser). Analysis as in the paper: Scenic Beauty Estimation (Daniel & Boster 1976): standardise each judge's scores (z), average the z scores per photo to get its SBE value, and compare winter with summer at each site; the paper then correlated SBE values with colour saturation and colour diversity measured by scene parsing. Differences from the original study: (1) the paper's questionnaire had 17 questions but prints only the photo-rating part; the two background questions here (landscape-architecture background, education level) are our wording, based on the paper's description of its respondents; (2) the photographs come from the published figure, so they are smaller (about 400 x 280 px) than the camera originals; (3) one photo per screen instead of one scrolling questionnaire page.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"canal\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"landscape_background\",\n      \"title\": \"Have you studied landscape architecture (or a closely related design field)?\",\n      \"description\": \"Our wording; the paper compared respondents with and without a landscape-architecture education background.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"yes\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"no\",\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"education\",\n      \"title\": \"What is your highest level of education?\",\n      \"description\": \"Our wording; the paper reports respondents with different levels of education.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"high_school_or_below\",\n        \"text\": \"High school or below\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"college\",\n        \"text\": \"College or bachelor's degree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"postgraduate\",\n        \"text\": \"Master's or doctorate\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"photos\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"beauty\",\n      \"title\": \"How much do you like this landscape?\",\n      \"rateMin\": -3,\n      \"rateMax\": 3,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Strongly dislike\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Strongly like\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Paper's 7-point scale: -3 strongly dislike, -2 dislike, -1 somewhat dislike, 0 average, 1 somewhat like, 2 like, 3 strongly like. Keyed by photo number in the paper's Fig. 4: 01_dggd_winter, 02_dggd_summer (Site 1 Dongguan Gudu), 03_gms_winter, 04_gms_summer (Site 2 Gaomin Temple), 05_gzgd_winter, 06_gzgd_summer (Site 3 Guazhou Gudu), 07_yhsw_winter, 08_yhsw_summer (Site 4 Canal Three Bays), 09_yzjgd_winter, 10_yzjgd_summer (Site 5 YZJGD).\"\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"canal-original\">{\"source\": \"Wang, Qian, Cao, Fan & Han (2025) Scientific Reports 15: 7500\", \"n\": 358, \"participants\": \"358 respondents with or without a landscape-architecture education background and various education levels; online questionnaire on WJX.cn, 2023\", \"sbe\": {\"Site1 DGGD\": {\"winter\": 0.1475, \"summer\": -0.1664}, \"Site2 GMS\": {\"winter\": 0.5956, \"summer\": 0.4169}, \"Site3 GZGD\": {\"winter\": 0.3796, \"summer\": 0.0386}, \"Site4 YHSW\": {\"winter\": -0.3012, \"summer\": 0.1127}, \"Site5 YZJGD\": {\"winter\": -0.8216, \"summer\": -0.4017}}, \"result\": \"KMO 0.804, reliability 0.938. Gaomin Temple scored highest and YZJGD (high-rises and a pylon on the far bank) lowest in both seasons; Dongguan Gudu, Gaomin Temple and Guazhou Gudu scored higher in winter, Canal Three Bays and YZJGD in summer. Correlations of SBE with colour saturation (r = -0.625 winter, 0.689 summer) and colour diversity (0.807 winter, -0.747 summer) were not significant with five sites.\"}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f1f3f6;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d2430;--muted:#5a6372;--accent:#2b5d8a;--line:#d8dee7;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#e3edf7}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.view{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:5}\n.view img{width:min(96vw,720px);height:auto;display:block}\n.cross{font-size:48px;color:#333;font-weight:300}\n.thumb{width:100%;max-width:420px;border-radius:8px;display:block;margin:0 auto 12px}\n.bi{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}.bi .l{text-align:right;font-size:.88rem}.bi .r{font-size:.88rem}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,40px);gap:4px}\n.row label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:.82rem}\n.row label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.row input{margin:0 0 2px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.bi{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.bi .row{grid-column:1/-1;order:3;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}.bi .l{text-align:left}.bi .r{text-align:right}}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}\ntextarea{width:100%;font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;min-height:60px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\n.f{margin-top:16px}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:110px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.cropw{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 12px}.crop{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%;border-radius:8px}\n.crop img{position:absolute;max-width:none;display:block}\n.row7{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}\n.row7 label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 2px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.72rem;text-align:center;line-height:1.2}\n.row7 label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.row7 b{font-size:.95rem}\n@media(max-width:560px){.row7{grid-template-columns:1fr}.row7 label{flex-direction:row;gap:10px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:.92rem;text-align:left}.row7 b{min-width:26px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs: Wang, Qian, Cao, Fan &amp; Han (2025), Scientific Reports 15: 7500, Fig. 4 (doi:10.1038/s41598-025-91483-1), licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>. The figure file is used unaltered; each photo is shown by cropping the view in the browser.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='yangzhou-canal:state', W=2008;\n  var COLS=[[3,395],[402,801],[811,1198],[1211,1597],[1612,1992]], ROWS=[[67,349],[481,760]];\n  var PH=[['01_dggd_winter','Dongguan Gudu, winter'],['02_dggd_summer','Dongguan Gudu, summer'],['03_gms_winter','Gaomin Temple, winter'],['04_gms_summer','Gaomin Temple, summer'],['05_gzgd_winter','Guazhou Gudu, winter'],['06_gzgd_summer','Guazhou Gudu, summer'],['07_yhsw_winter','Canal Three Bays, winter'],['08_yhsw_summer','Canal Three Bays, summer'],['09_yzjgd_winter','Site 5 (YZJGD), winter'],['10_yzjgd_summer','Site 5 (YZJGD), summer']];\n  var LAB=['Strongly dislike','Dislike','Somewhat dislike','Average','Somewhat like','Like','Strongly like'];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, fig=null, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function val(name){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+name+'\"]:checked');return x?x.value:null;}\n  function radios(q){return '<div class=\"f\"><b>'+esc(Q[q].title)+'</b>'+(Q[q].choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+q+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function crop(k){var c=COLS[k%5],r=ROWS[Math.floor(k/5)],w=c[1]-c[0],h=r[1]-r[0];\n    return '<div class=\"cropw\"><div class=\"crop\" style=\"padding-top:'+(h/w*100).toFixed(3)+'%\"><img alt=\"Photograph No. '+(k+1)+' of the Yangzhou ancient canal\" src=\"'+esc(fig.url)+'\" style=\"width:'+(W/w*100).toFixed(3)+'%;left:'+(-c[0]/w*100).toFixed(3)+'%;top:'+(-r[0]/h*100).toFixed(3)+'%\"></div></div>';}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Yangzhou ancient canal</h1><p>You will see '+PH.length+' photographs of five places along the ancient Grand Canal in Yangzhou, China, each taken once in winter and once in summer. Rate how much you like each landscape from −3 (strongly dislike) to +3 (strongly like). It takes about 3 minutes.</p><div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='about';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\">'+radios('landscape_background')+radios('education')+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var a=val('landscape_background'),ed=val('education');\n      if(!a||!ed)return err('Please answer both questions.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('landscape_background',a),SPSite.answer('education',ed)],this,function(){st.step='rate';st.k=0;save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function rate(){\n    var k=st.k,h='<div class=\"row7\">';for(var i=-3;i<=3;i++)h+='<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q\" value=\"'+i+'\"><b>'+(i>0?'+'+i:i)+'</b>'+LAB[i+3]+'</label>';h+='</div>';\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Photo No. '+(k+1)+' of '+PH.length+'</div><div class=\"card\">'+crop(k)+'<b>'+esc(Q.beauty.title)+'</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\">'+h+'</div><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(k+1<PH.length?'Next photo':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var v=val('q');if(v==null)return err('Please choose a score.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('beauty',Number(v),{key:PH[k][0],shown:[fig.name]})],this,function(){st.k++;if(st.k>=PH.length)st.step='done';save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='rate')return rate();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','landscape_background','education','beauty'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('canal')||[]).forEach(function(f){if(/fig4\\.(png|jpe?g)$/i.test(f.name))fig=f;});\n    if(!fig){app.innerHTML='<h1>Figure missing</h1><p>Upload yangzhou_canal_fig4.jpg to the media folder \"canal\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    if(!st||typeof st.k!=='number')st={step:'intro',k:0};\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};if(a.consent!==true){st.step='intro';st.k=0;}\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
